19153      /* STAT-SURVEYFREQ-003: SURVEYFREQ — Taylor Series Variance Estimation
19154       * Source: S154 / Chapter 118 / `Taylor Series Variance Estimation` (PDF pp. 9632–9633).
19155       * Discriminates: Verified default procedure context
19156       */
19157      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
19157    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
19158      %let syscc=0;
19159      title; footnote;
19160      ods _all_ close;
19161      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
19162      ods graphics off;
19163      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SURVEY (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
19163    !                                         quit;


19164      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
19165      
19166      data survey;
19167      do state=1 to 2;
19168      do school=1 to 4;
19169      do id=1 to 6;
19170      response=1+mod(id+school,3);
19171      schooltype=1+mod(school,2);
19172      samplingweight=2+state+school/10;
19173      output;
19174      end;
19175      end;
19176      end;
19177      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 48 observations and 6 variables.

19178      proc surveyfreq data=survey;
19179      strata state;
19180      cluster school;
19181      weight samplingweight;
19182      tables schooltype*response / row chisq;
19183      run;

NOTE: The Rao-Scott chi-square test cannot be computed for the table of schooltype by response because the design correction is not positive.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYFREQ printed page 1379.

